# Slim registration (shared with Attendance and Mock Evaluation)

Do not add **qualification**, **expertise**, or **reason** to staff/trainer registration forms or APIs.

Those fields are unused across FirstBit apps. Keep registration to identity fields only (Student Management already uses name, email, designation, employee ID, and requested role — do not add the unused trainer fields).
